Z||000000||88GT3||06-02-2000||11:35 PM||||I test drove an 88GT today.  It is red with 177,000 miles on it.  The weather stripping is shot, the car was keyed on the pasnager side, the sail panels are cracked, and it sound as though there is an exhause leak in the forward exhaust manifold.  Also, the dash is faded and the e-brake doesn't work, but man I just loved driving it. It has been five years since I drove a Fiero and I enjoyed every minute of the test drive.<P>He is asking 2200 for it.  What do you guys think?||||reg||10
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||06-03-2000||12:42 AM||||Near as I can tell a really nice GT is going from $4000.00 to $6000.00. That leaves you a lot of room to bring this car up to snuff. Depends on you. Do you really like this car and do you want to work on one or just jump in and drive ? I just bought an 85 GT fastback conversion for about the same money. It needs paint and some wiring problems worked out and a little TLC. It will be nice when I'm done though.||||reg||6
Z||000002||88GT3||06-03-2000||01:03 AM||||2m4Dale,<P>I actually plan on using this car as a project car at a later date.  I want to do some suspension upgrade and an engine swap.  I realize it will take some work to bring this car up to snuff, but I am willing to do it. I just don't want to pay too much.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Sillhouette.com||06-03-2000||01:43 AM||||Negotiate the price down more because of the exhaust leak.  Look at the front exhaust manifolds and see if the head bolts that are supposed to hold on the manifold are broken out of the cylinder head.  You'll need to get that look at quite soon.  If not anytime the sunroof is open toxic fumes will get into the cabin and hurt your eyes throat etc. With an exhaust leak you'll find the car sluggish anyone with a four cylinder will be able to run around you.  If your area has emmision testing it will not pass.  <BR>Other than that it sounds like a good buy.<P>Cheers.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||GT Bastard||06-04-2000||08:06 PM||||Toxic fumes getting into your car though the sunroof?  My front manifold used to leak in 3 places and I always had my sunroof open.  Never a problem.||||reg||1
Z||000005||stimpy||06-04-2000||08:22 PM||||Brain damage is an insidious thing.We have seen pictures of the hair colors. Can you be sure there was never a problem?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
